<tablerow>
<tablecell>
<par def='4'/></tablecell>
<tablecell>
<par def='5'>The <run><font style='underline'/>new Order's are now always visible by the member of a project</run>.  In the past some new orders were visible only to the person creating it until it was mailed to the Administrator.</par></tablecell></tablerow>
<tablerow>
<tablecell>
<par def='4'/></tablecell>
<tablecell>
<par def='5'>The <run><font style='underline'/>Order's status is now displayed on top of the Order form</run>.  Note that some Orders from previous fiscal years are using an old form that does not display the status. </par>
