<tablecell columnspan='2'>
<par def='6'><run><font style='bold'/>Company Form</run></par></tablecell></tablerow>
<tablerow>
<tablecell>
<par def='4'/></tablecell>
<tablecell>
<par def='5'>On the Company form, the <run><font style='underline'/>fields "MasterCard" and "VISA" are now accepting specific values: "Yes", "No", and "N/A"</run>.  The values are chosen using a drop down list and no longer accept unlisted values.  This will eliminate validation problems cause by unsupported values.</par>
