<tablecell columnspan='2'>
<par def='6'><run><font style='bold'/>New Features</run></par></tablecell></tablerow>
<tablerow>
<tablecell>
<par def='4'/></tablecell>
<tablecell>
<par def='5'>The <run><font style='underline'/>system is now allowing partially received orders</run>.  Partially Received orders have at least one item without the received checkbox.  The system will change the Status from and to "On Order", "Partially Received" and "Received" automatically when saving an order.  The Partially Received orders are grouped together when looking at the view "View By Status".</par>
